        "A pilot must establish clear, specific personal minima for weather conditions before departure, going beyond simply the legal VMC minima to reflect their own experience level, currency, and comfort with the specific conditions forecast, particularly regarding cloud base, visibility, and wind, including any crosswind component relevant to the departure and destination runways.",
